+/*
+ * Voltages come from the vendor tables for a 26 MHz oscillator; the speed
+ * bin index follows the order of the vendor vf0000, vf0100, vf0200, vf0300,
+ * vf0400, vf0401, vf0500, vf0501 and vf0600 tables.
+ */
